   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Development Programme - Improving resilience of coral reefs and dependent communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project focuses on creating sustainable risk management solutions by using insurance to protect natural coastal assets that generate revenue and offer defense against natural weather events. It will develop and implement a coral reef insurance program in Indonesia, significantly reducing the vulnerability of low-income coastal communities to climate-related disasters.</narrative>
